a nossa erva.

588
00:42:37,066 --> 00:42:39,377
Não irei. Prometo.

589
00:42:39,833 --> 00:42:41,890
- Tchau.
<i>- Tchau.</i>

590
00:42:43,302 --> 00:42:46,200
Merda!

591
00:42:46,395 --> 00:42:47,767
Merda!

592
